R-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">룸메이트 사전지정신청은 동계방학 입사자 전원 신청 가능하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">동일호실 배정신청은 동계</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">방학입사 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">희망자 중 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학기 거주호실과 동일 호실 거주를 원하는 아래 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대상자에 한하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신청이 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신청기간 이후에는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">접수가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">불가하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">필히 정해진</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong>내</strong></font>에 신청해 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청구분 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 22.31pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 76.79pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-A